    {
      "title": "Brendan Nugent’s family say Helen Haines has been their friend for more than 20 years",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/oct/20/brendan-nugent-driver-alleged-attack-helen-haines-ntwnfb",
      "description": "<p>Father of 43-year-old Tarrawingee man who allegedly attacked the independent MP says incident is ‘devastating and unfathomable’</p><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/oct/19/who-is-helen-haines-the-mp-allegedly-attacked-in-victoria-ntwnfb\">Who is Helen Haines, the MP allegedly attacked in Victoria?</a></p></li><li><p>Get our <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/email-newsletters?CMP=cvau_sfl\">new political email</a>, <a href=\"https://app.adjust.com/w4u7jx3\">free app</a> or <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/series/full-story?CMP=cvau_sfl\">daily news podcast</a></p></li></ul><p>The father of a 43-year-old man accused of allegedly attacking Helen Haines has pledged to work with police and described the incident as “shocking and horrific”.</p><p>The independent MP remained in a critical condition on Tuesday after being airlifted from Wangaratta in northern <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/victoria\">Victoria</a> to Melbourne’s Alfred hospital for emergency surgery on Monday night. She has lost one leg, with surgeons working to save the other.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/oct/20/brendan-nugent-driver-alleged-attack-helen-haines-ntwnfb\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "source_name": "The Guardian World",
      "published": "2026-10-20T10:37:10"
    },
    {
      "title": "Brendan Nugent facing three charges over alleged attack on MP Helen Haines",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/oct/20/helen-haines-alleged-attacker-brendan-nugent-charged-ntwnfb",
      "description": "<p>Victoria police arrested the 43-year-old Tarrawingee man on Monday afternoon after the incident in Wangaratta</p><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/oct/19/who-is-helen-haines-the-mp-allegedly-attacked-in-victoria-ntwnfb\">Who is Helen Haines, the MP allegedly attacked in Victoria?</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/oct/20/brendan-nugent-driver-alleged-attack-helen-haines-ntwnfb\">Brendan Nugent’s family say Haines has been their friend for more than 20 years</a></p></li><li><p>Get our <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/email-newsletters?CMP=cvau_sfl\">new political email</a>, <a href=\"https://app.adjust.com/w4u7jx3\">free app</a> or <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/series/full-story?CMP=cvau_sfl\">daily news podcast</a></p></li></ul><p>Helen Haines’ alleged attacker, Brendan Nugent, has been charged with dangerous driving causing serious injury, intentionally cause serious injury and the commonwealth offence of causing harm to a commonwealth public official.</p><p>He will be held overnight to appear at Wangaratta magistrates court on Wednesday, Victoria police confirmed in a statement, adding that it would be alleged the attack was targeted.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/oct/20/helen-haines-alleged-attacker-brendan-nugent-charged-ntwnfb\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "source_name": "The Guardian World",
      "published": "2026-10-20T09:18:58"
    },
    {
      "title": "A young life ‘dominated by gambling’: Victorian coroner delivers stinging findings on death of 22-year-old",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/oct/20/kyle-hudson-inquest-victorian-coroner-gambling-online-betting-ntwnfb",
      "description": "<p>Online betting was the ‘direct and paramount’ cause behind Kyle Hudson’s decision to take his own life, inquest finds</p><ul><li><p>Get our <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/email-newsletters?CMP=cvau_sfl\">breaking news email</a>, <a href=\"https://app.adjust.com/w4u7jx3\">free app</a> or <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/series/full-story?CMP=cvau_sfl\">daily news podcast</a></p></li></ul><p>Kyle Hudson was “a young man brimming with promise”, with a loving and supportive partner, family and friends, and prospects.</p><p>“It was a near ideal picture – except for the grip that online sports betting had upon him,” the Victorian coroner Paul Lawrie said on Tuesday.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/oct/20/kyle-hudson-inquest-victorian-coroner-gambling-online-betting-ntwnfb\">Continue reading...</a>",
